      "open_entry_contests": "The key-check contests a cell on its cause entries and on the board's exclusion records (docs/coverage.md rule 2) even where a run of another lineage gives the key's answer, and every cause entry is open. crosscheck changes a status only on a closed ledger entry and holds no board record, so the agreeing runs reproduce the cell.",
